{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "washtenaw-userdb-lev",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.82: a LEV input database merged into a DEFAULT-domain run -- `washtenaw_cdb` as moves.rs `characterization/county-inputs/washtenaw-userdb-lev/setup-lev.sql` builds it for `userdb-lev` and `rates-lev`, which name it in `<databaseselections>`. That SQL is MOVES 5's own LEV builder script, database/LEV_NLEVScripts/MOVES5_MyLEVS_Template.sql, with the LEV tool's two substitutions and the user's one edit (model-year groups 1999-2003 and 2010-2017 kept), so the database holds ONE table, emissionRateByAge: emissionRateByAgeLEV's rows at the ten pollutant-processes the template names and the kept groups. MOVES merges it before the default database with INSERT IGNORE, so its rows replace the default's at their keys (`erba_mergedMeanBaseRate`). So this document is the DEFAULT-domain catalogue `moves-onroad.esm` plus the one table, declared here and shadowing the default database's empty input side (docs/esm-conventions.md §119.4, §133).\n\nIT DOES NOT LOAD ALONE: it names no runspec.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "domain",
      "default-domain",
      "user-input-database",
      "lev"
    ]
  },
  "metaparameters": {
    "n_outputRate": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 375,
      "description": "Relayed to `moves-onroad.esm`, which says what it is (docs/esm-conventions.md §49.1)."
    },
    "n_sourceBin": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 1,
      "description": "Relayed to `moves-onroad.esm`, which says what it is (docs/esm-conventions.md §49.1)."
    },
    "n_physicsRow": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 1,
      "description": "Relayed to `moves-onroad.esm`, which says what it is (docs/esm-conventions.md §49.1)."
    },
    "n_ratesScale": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 0,
      "description": "Relayed to `moves-onroad.esm`, which says what it is (docs/esm-conventions.md §49.1)."
    },
    "n_outputSumsDays": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 0,
      "description": "Relayed to `moves-onroad.esm`, which says what it is (docs/esm-conventions.md §49.1)."
    },
    "n_outputSumsMonths": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 0,
      "description": "Relayed to `moves-onroad.esm`, which says what it is (docs/esm-conventions.md §49.1)."
    },
    "n_outputSumsHours": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 0,
      "description": "Relayed to `moves-onroad.esm`, which says what it is (docs/esm-conventions.md §49.1)."
    },
    "n_outputClassicalDay": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 1,
      "description": "Relayed to `moves-onroad.esm`, which says what it is (docs/esm-conventions.md §49.1)."
    },
    "n_aggregatesMonths": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 0,
      "description": "Relayed to `moves-onroad.esm`, which says what it is (docs/esm-conventions.md §49.1)."
    },
    "n_statedEnergyProcesses": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 0,
      "description": "Relayed to `moves-onroad.esm`, which says what it is (docs/esm-conventions.md §49.1)."
    }
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_input_emissionratebyage": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-userdb-lev/EmissionRateByAge.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_inputemissionratebyage"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "rates",
          "user-input-database"
        ],
        "note": "The LEV database's emissionRateByAge as setup-lev.sql states it: 48,657 rows of the default database's emissionRateByAgeLEV, `polprocessid in (101,201,301,102,202,302,11201,11202,11801,11802) and mid(sourcebinid,8,2) in ('',99,20,21,22,23,30,...,37)` -- gasoline, diesel and E85 at regulatory classes 20 and 30 (the LEV table holds no other), model years 1999-2003 and 2010-2017 (2017 only where the LEV table has a row: none at class 20, half at class 30), at six of the ten pollutant-processes: THC, CO and NOx at running and start (12,075 / 12,075 / 12,075 / 4,200 / 4,200 / 4,032 rows). The LEV table's EC and NonECPM rows are at model-year group 45 (2025) only. Written by `tools/build-scale-input-db.py --copy emissionratebyage` from that SQL; equal, row for row and value for value, to the user database the capture dumped (`db__washtenaw_cdb__emissionratebyage`). Every key is a default key, so the merge replaces 48,657 default values and adds no row.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "Onroad": {
      "ref": "../moves-onroad.esm",
      "bindings": {
        "n_outputRate": "n_outputRate",
        "n_sourceBin": "n_sourceBin",
        "n_physicsRow": "n_physicsRow",
        "n_ratesScale": "n_ratesScale",
        "n_outputSumsDays": "n_outputSumsDays",
        "n_outputSumsMonths": "n_outputSumsMonths",
        "n_outputSumsHours": "n_outputSumsHours",
        "n_outputClassicalDay": "n_outputClassicalDay",
        "n_aggregatesMonths": "n_aggregatesMonths",
        "n_statedEnergyProcesses": "n_statedEnergyProcesses"
      }
    }
  }
}
